WEBVTT

00:12:58.531 --> 00:13:00.458
And by doing that,

00:13:00.458 --> 00:13:03.362
he's interfering with the activity of this brain region

00:13:03.362 --> 00:13:04.577
for about half an hour.

00:13:04.577 --> 00:13:07.498
After that everything goes back to normal, I assure you.

00:13:07.498 --> 00:13:09.491
(Laughter)

00:13:09.491 --> 00:13:12.645
So let's see what happens.

00:13:12.645 --> 00:13:14.742
First of all, I'm going to show you

00:13:14.742 --> 00:13:17.446
the average amount of bias that we see.

00:13:17.446 --> 00:13:20.269
So if I was to test all of you now,

00:13:20.269 --> 00:13:22.063
this is the amount that you would learn

00:13:22.063 --> 00:13:25.183
more from good news relative to bad news.

00:13:25.183 --> 00:13:27.667
Now we interfere with the region

00:13:27.667 --> 00:13:32.134
that we found to integrate negative information in this task,